family: F3
grade: judge

--- prompt ---
Opening https://typo3-dev-mcp-bench.ddev.site/products returns an error instead of the
page.

Diagnose the root cause. Name the exact file and the exact problem. Do not fix it.

--- setup ---
# A ViewHelper argument that does not exist. The exception names the ViewHelper but
# not the template file, so the agent has to connect the error to the source.
sed -i.bak 's|<f:format.html>{data.bodytext}</f:format.html>|<f:format.html parseFuncPath="lib.parseFunc" wrapper="div">{data.bodytext}</f:format.html>|' \
    packages/bench_fixture/Resources/Private/Templates/BenchCard.html
rm -f packages/bench_fixture/Resources/Private/Templates/BenchCard.html.bak
ddev exec vendor/bin/typo3 cache:flush >/dev/null 2>&1
# Trigger the failure so the log tools have something to read.
curl -sk -o /dev/null https://typo3-dev-mcp-bench.ddev.site/products || true

--- oracle ---
echo "Root cause: BenchCard.html passes an undefined argument 'wrapper' to <f:format.html>."
echo "File: packages/bench_fixture/Resources/Private/Templates/BenchCard.html"
echo "f:format.html accepts parseFuncTSPath (not parseFuncPath) and has no 'wrapper' argument."

--- check ---
exit 2
